5.To delete such duplicates: 
Run this code in CloudShell: 
import boto3 
dynamodb = boto3.resource('dynamodb') 
table = dynamodb.Table('22bd1a056b_exp9') 
response = table.scan() 
items = response['Items'] 
seen = set() 
for item in items: 
    ident = (item['name'], item['subject'], int(item['rating'])) 
    if ident in seen: 
        print(f"Deleting duplicate: {item}") 
        table.delete_item(Key={'rollno': item['rollno']}) 
    else: 
        seen.add(ident)

